// Folder "Fresh Food Survey" scanned recursively (Layout/To-Be, Layout/As-Is, …). A file maps to a store by:
//   1. leading digits "<digits>_name.ext": 5 = gold code, 6 = Oracle, 3 = last three digits of the gold code
//      (As-Is files from SRD: "128_SUKSAWAT_AS IS_(07-09-26).pdf");
//   2. otherwise its normalised name — FFR_LAYOUT_ALIAS (spellings that differ from FFR_STORES, checked by hand
//      16 Nov 2026) or an exact match to the normalised store name (To-Be files: "Suksawat.pdf").
// No fuzzy matching — a near-miss name (e.g. "Nongki" vs "Ranong") must never attach to the wrong store.
